OL,3,GNEWSAStates schools limited to 5
OL,4,Abranded uniform items
OL,5,
OL,6,FA school uniform policy limiting States
OL,7,Fschools to five branded uniform items
OL,8,Fper child have been put in place.
OL,10,FThe States said this should be "a
OL,11,Fwelcome relief" to household budgets as
OL,12,Fsome schools require 11 branded items
OL,13,Fof clothing, costing hundreds to pay
OL,14,Ffor uniform, PE kit and equipment.
OL,16,FThe policy was announced in 2023, with
OL,17,Fschools needing to comply by next month
OL,18,Fin time for the new school term.
OL,19,FEligible families can also get up to
OL,20,F#150 help for each child's
OL,21,Fback-to-school costs with a government
OL,22,Fbonus.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
